{
"note_claim": "The photo of a Kelly Clarkson cutout at Art of Play appears digitally altered.",
"label": "DOES_NOT_SUPPORT",
"quote": "The owners of a popular Brooklyn novelty shop pushed back amid a wave of online vitriol Sunday after Kelly Clarkson claimed she'd gotten the so-called \"Pretty Woman\" treatment during a recent visit, saying that the item the \"American Idol\" star wanted to buy was the store's mascot, which wasn't for sale.",
"reason": "The article reports on a dispute regarding a bird automaton mascot but makes no mention of a Kelly Clarkson cutout, its authenticity, or the storefront's display."
}
